desc:
*HW supplier shall notify the STATUS_CCAN3.EngineSts signal via the VHAL interface.
*CarPropertyService shall receive the STATUS_CCAN3.EngineSts signal and send that to CarPropertyManager via Interface.
*CarPropertyManager will expose that value to HMI shall via API interface as get/set methods.
*The HMI shall evaluate the received signal and compare it with the internally stored status of the system.
*ELSE IF (STATUS_CCAN3.EngineSts == “Engine_On”)then
*The HMI shall retain the existing state and level of the Heated/Vented Seats or Heated Steering Wheel button(s);
*The HMI shall allow the Vented Seats buttons to be selectable, as defined in Section ‘Vented Seats’;
*The HMI shall allow the Heated Steering Wheel buttons to be selectable, as defined in Section ‘Heated Steering Wheel’;
